:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为设施固定成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为运输成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为运营可变成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li>2025-2026 年&quot;韧性供应链&quot;成为首要战略目标，企业普遍建立多源供应和区域化布局</li>\n<li>AI 驱动的供应链控制塔（Control Tower）实现全链路可视化和自动决策</li>\n<li>数字孪生供应链模拟极端情景（疫情、地缘冲突、自然灾害）进行压力测试</li>\n<li>&quot;近岸外包&quot;（Nearshoring）趋势下，中国企业加速在东南亚和墨西哥建立供应链节点</li>\n<li>供应链碳中和承诺推动 Scope 3 排放核算和绿色供应商准入</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>选择一个你熟悉的品牌（如优衣库或华为手机），分析其产品属于功能性还是创新性，对应的供应链战略是什么？</li>\n<li>通过&quot;啤酒游戏&quot;模拟实验，记录四级供应链（零售商→批发商→分销商→工厂）的订货量波动，验证牛鞭效应并分析成因。</li>\n<li>某快消品企业实施 VMI 后，零售商库存周转天数从 30 天降至 18 天，但供应商库存增加了 20%。分析 VMI 的利弊并提出改进方案。</li>\n<li>设计一个包含 2 个工厂、3 个区域仓库、10 个城市市场的供应链网络，确定最优的仓库选址和需求分配方案。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>供应链战略的核心是实现战略匹配——让供应链的效率/响应定位与产品的需求不确定性相匹配。推拉边界和延迟策略是平衡效率与柔性的关键工具。供应链协同通过信息共享和联合决策消除牛鞭效应，VMI 和 CPFR 是典型的协同模式。网络设计则从物理布局层面决定供应链的成本和服务能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"供应链战略与协同","id":"供应链战略与协同"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"供应链战略匹配框架","id":"供应链战略匹配框架"},{"level":3,"text":"推拉策略与延迟策略","id":"推拉策略与延迟策略"},{"level":3,"text":"牛鞭效应与信息共享","id":"牛鞭效应与信息共享"},{"level":3,"text":"供应链合作伙伴管理","id":"供应链合作伙伴管理"},{"level":3,"text":"供应链网络设计","id":"供应链网络设计"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"供应链战略与网络设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/supply-chain-management/supply-chain-strategy-design"},"next":{"title":"采购与库存优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/supply-chain-management/procurement-inventory-optimization"}}